;; 委 yudane — seed (Human Intention Energy Engine: CONSENTED AGGREGATE cohort offers).
;;
;; Each row is a CONTENT-FREE, AGGREGATE cohort intention→flex offer — NOT a person.
;; It crosses the membrane to 撓 tawami / 澪 mio only if it is CONSENTED: a member-signed
;; capability that is present, unexpired, reciprocal, and over a cohort of at least the
;; k-anonymity floor (5) so no individual is identifiable.
;;
;; There is NO per-person field here — by construction. The intention is a CLASS, never
;; content. Rows default to :representative (synthetic cohorts).
;;
;; fields:
;;   :intent-class   one of #{:presence-shift :defer-flexible :schedule-known :seasonal-prep}.
;;   :cohort-size    AGGREGATE count of consenting members (k-anonymity gate).
;;   :capability     opaque consent-token reference (present ⇒ member-signed); nil ⇒ no consent.
;;   :cap-expiry-h   hours until the capability expires (≤0 ⇒ expired ⇒ refused).
;;   :reciprocal     is the exchange reciprocal + logged (moyai)? false ⇒ refused.
;;   :flex-kwh       AGGREGATE shiftable energy the intention implies.
